Subject: [PATCH 38/63] BugTrackingSystem 1656 : 'devtools://' scheme is
 excluded from trust/untrust judgment

---
 content/browser/web_contents/web_contents_impl.cc | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

Index: gooroom-browser-debian.git/content/browser/web_contents/web_contents_impl.cc
